      {
         "id": "c",
         "prompt": "Let \\( h(x) = \\dfrac{\\ln x}{\\sqrt{x}} \\) for \\( x > 0 \\). Write a limit expression that describes the behavior of \\( h(x) \\) as \\( x \\) increases without bound, and find its value.",
